  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xe4;ngelsesamarbete- LET</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prison programme-LAT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An important element of a democracy is to have well functioning state institutions for upholding the rule of law and the respect for human rights. Development of the Latvian penitentiary system is therefore of vital importance.The objective is to bring the Latvian Prison system into conformity with EU standards.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fungerande institutioner f&#xf6;r att upr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla lag och ordning och respekt f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter &#xe4;r en viktig del i demokratin. Utveckling av det Lettiska f&#xe4;ngelsesystemet &#xe4;r d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r en viktig insats. M&#xe5;let f&#xf6;r projektet &#xe4;r att den Lettiska f&#xe4;ngelsev&#xe5;rden ska kunna uppfylla EUs krav.</narrative>
  </description>
